R7-code ran this test against round six's build.rs on this machine (an i5-12400F), with the other default parts beside it (work/R7-code/before-ref2.log:50). In debug, as CI runs it, round six's code took 10.26 s for one selection and 46.75 s for 21 reruns, against bounds of 8 s and 48 s:
